LRC14 route-state closure median scout (codex S240)
==========================================================

State coordinates: 45
States: 17
Closure rules: 11

Assumption challenge
  Vertices are proof states, not runners: packet states, route obligations, certificate generators, sidecar coordinates, and discharge exits.
  Preserved predicate: whether a serious route triple has a unique legal majority center after sidecars are attached.
  Destroyed data: raw runner names, raw time geometry, and the distinction between two witnesses that agree on all retained proof coordinates.
  Challenged assumption: discharge mode is not a label on a route; it must be a coordinate, otherwise median centers can look legal while hiding F7/THM-572 debt.

